  "notes": [
    "Runnable benchmark registry contains the six open-source speech models listed in SOVA-Bench Table 3, plus the proposed Emotional Voice Assistant.",
    "Cascade (Whisper-large-v3 + GPT-4o-mini) remains only as a published-paper reference; it is excluded from live runs because GPT-4o-mini requires a paid API. No replacement model is substituted as the paper Cascade.",
    "GPT-OSS 120B is the user’s existing Emotion Aware Voice Assistant LLM and can be used as the QA/semantic judge via the user’s already configured Groq access. It is not a SOVA-Bench baseline; record it as judge model and do not claim exact reproduction of the authors’ unspecified GPTEval prompts.",
    "paper_support indicates whether Table 4 reports a metric, not whether a run has been executed.",
    "Published Table 4 values are stored in paper_reference_table4.json and are not measurements from this code.",
    "Model weights and official environments are not bundled. Each upstream open-source model needs its own compatible runtime/checkpoint, and hardware may be a limiting factor."
  ],
  "excluded_models": [
